 rning. SESSION COUNT: 3 runs\, 3-4 swims\, 2 bikes\, 1 legs\, 6 days wit
 h Thursday off. That is ~9-10 h/week\, which is INTERMEDIATE volume - My
 ProCoach's beginner 70.3 plan averages 7 h. If adherence slips\, scale t
