 ys with Thursday off. That is ~9-10 h/week\, which is INTERMEDIATE volum
 e - MyProCoach's beginner 70.3 plan averages 7 h. If adherence slips\, s
 cale to the beginner shape rather than abandoning weeks. CUT ORDER: (1) 
