DTSTAMP:20260908T091756Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270214
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270215
SUMMARY:○ Long ride 70 km steady (170 min)
DESCRIPTION:Long ride 70 km steady\n\nWeek 3 of 12 - Base\nBuy the wetsui
 t now. Buy for BUOYANCY not speed - beginner suits run 5 mm through core
 /hips/legs\, which directly fixes the sinking-legs problem. Wetsuits giv
 e the biggest gain to inefficient low-buoyancy swimmers\, i.e. you: 5-11
 %\, roughly 2-4 min over 1.9 km. Also buy neoprene BOOTIES - legal below
  18.3 C and the water will be 15-17 C.\n69 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-J
 esolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
