SUMMARY:≈ Swim 40 min
DESCRIPTION:Swim 40 min - first session IN THE WETSUIT (pool). Chest cons
 triction can feel like breathlessness\; get used to it now.\n\nWeek 3 of
  12 - Base\nBuy the wetsuit now. Buy for BUOYANCY not speed - beginner s
 uits run 5 mm through core/hips/legs\, which directly fixes the sinking-
 legs problem. Wetsuits give the biggest gain to inefficient low-buoyancy
  swimmers\, i.e. you: 5-11%\, roughly 2-4 min over 1.9 km. Also buy neop
 rene BOOTIES - legal below 18.3 C and the water will be 15-17 C.\n66 day
 s to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ironman703venicejesolo-w3-s4-legs@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20260908T091756Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270217
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270218
SUMMARY:◆ Legs
DESCRIPTION:Legs - maintenance LOWER-LEG AND FOOT\, about 5 min at the en
 d: tibialis anterior raises 3 x 15-20 (heels on a step\, toes lifting)\,
  heel walks 2 x 20 m\, eccentric dorsiflexion 3 x 10 slow against a band
 \, short-foot holds 3 x 30 s per side\, tennis ball under the arch 60 s.
  An 8-week RCT in amateur runners raised lactate threshold velocity 5.9%
  with intrinsic foot work - but that was 30 min DAILY\, so treat this as
  maintaining the tissue that failed on 7 Sep\, not as a 5.9% gain.\n\nWe
 ek 3 of 12 - Base\nBuy the wetsuit now. Buy for BUOYANCY not speed - beg
 inner suits run 5 mm through core/hips/legs\, which directly fixes the s
 inking-legs problem. Wetsuits give the biggest gain to inefficient low-b
 uoyancy swimmers\, i.e. you: 5-11%\, roughly 2-4 min over 1.9 km. Also b
 uy neoprene BOOTIES - legal below 18.3 C and the water will be 15-17 C.\
 n66 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
