SUMMARY:○ Long ride 80 km\, last 20 km at race effort\,…
DESCRIPTION:Long ride 80 km\, last 20 km at race effort\, fuelling 60 g/h
 \n\nWeek 4 of 12 - Build\nGUT TRAINING STARTS - 8-12 weeks out is the wi
 ndow. Target 60-70 g carb/h on the bike\, NOT 90: measured exogenous glu
 cose oxidation is 33 g/h under 70 kg vs 45 g/h above it. At 56 kg your c
 eiling is genuinely lower. Fuel every session over 75 min\, +10-15 g/h e
 very 1-2 weeks\, and use the exact race products (Maurten\, Precision PH
  1000).\n62 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
