SUMMARY:○ Long ride 90 km (205 min)
DESCRIPTION:Long ride 90 km - full race distance\, fuelling rehearsal 60-
 70 g/h\n\nWeek 7 of 12 - Build\nTARGET: 1900 m continuous. The cutoff ne
 eds only 3:41/100 m and ANY STROKE IS LEGAL - breaststroke the whole thi
 ng is permitted\, and you may hold a buoy or kayak to rest provided you 
 make no forward progress. Knowing that is what stops the panic that actu
 ally causes swim DNFs.\n41 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
