SUMMARY:○ Long ride 100 km steady at IF 0.70 (225 min)
DESCRIPTION:Long ride 100 km steady at IF 0.70\n\nWeek 8 of 12 - Build\nB
 iggest week. Bike pacing: target IF 0.68-0.72\, cap the first 30 min 5 W
  BELOW target. Above 0.80 on a flat course is almost always a bike PB an
 d a run blow-up. Also: this is a NON-DRAFTING race - 6 bike lengths clea
 r\, pass within 25 s\, 5-minute penalty box. You ride in groups\; this i
 s a skill you do not have.\n34 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
