DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270328
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270329
SUMMARY:○ Long ride 110 km (245 min)
DESCRIPTION:Long ride 110 km - longest of the block\n\nWeek 9 of 12 - Pea
 k\nOPEN WATER STARTS - the single highest-consequence item in this plan.
  90 of 120 sudden deaths in US triathlon occurred in the swim\, and the 
 mechanism is cold-water panic\, not fitness. You should already have don
 e 5-6 cold immersions over the winter\; this is where it gets applied in
  a wetsuit.\n27 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
