SUMMARY:○ Easy spin 40 km (90 min)
DESCRIPTION:Easy spin 40 km\n\nWeek 12 of 12 - Race\nRACE WEEK. Swim 1\,8
 98 m single counterclockwise loop from Lighthouse Beach\, 4 turn buoys p
 lus directional buoys every 100 m - unusually easy to sight. SELF-SEEDED
  ROLLING START\, 3 athletes every 6 s: seed HONESTLY at 55-60 min\, you 
 will start ~08:15-08:30. Enter at the EDGE of your box. Water 15-17 C. W
 arm up in the water 06:30-07:00 then stay warm for 90 min. Swim the firs
 t 200 m deliberately too slowly. CUT-OFFS: swim 1:10 (absolute - zero fi
 nishers in 19\,137 splits swam over 70:00)\, bike 5:30\, overall 8:30. T
 RANSITION IS ~1 KM FROM THE SWIM START - two venues\, walk it Friday. Ta
 rget 6:15-7:15. Venice is a fast race: M25-29 median is 5:12\, so you wi
 ll be near the back of a quick field. That is fine.\n6 days to IRONMAN 7
 0.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
